  "scopeLimits": [
    "One new 32-case test file only. All 1045 parent sources, runtime product and existing tests are byte-for-byte unchanged.",
    "Real HTTP login/enrollment/TOTP; same bearer/SID. Global binding without platform flag for authority withdrawal; fictitious actors only.",
    "Two scopes, four real effects and four failure modes. Narrow AFTER triggers and sequence witnesses prove actual cursor deletion, daily update, gate cancellation and durable delivery cancellation before complete rollback.",
    "All rows in 14 business/audit/outbox tables, all tenants and the actor proof/factor/recovery/global binding are compared; transactional NOTIFY absence is fenced by a committed listener barrier.",
    "This tests transactional rollback inside the helper, not separate-client races, hardware/dispatch, external webhooks, browsers, apps or performance. No new RED/GREEN product change.",
    "V1 type-runner pin typo and V2 fixture TTL failure are preserved separately. V3 only uses the same statement timestamp for fixture creation/expiry, preserving every assertion and timeout.",
    "Earlier eight lifecycle and 117 independent configuration results retain their own source/run evidence; no combined current-run count. MFA068 remains candidate, runtime main001-067. Remaining plan and production acceptance pending."
